@startuml
' 图名：下单支付时序图
' 撰写成员：架构设计智能体
' 对应版本：v1.0

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "用户" as U
participant "用户端前端\nVue3 + Axios" as FE
participant "网关/鉴权\nSpring Security + JWT" as GW
participant "订单服务\nOrderService" as OS
participant "库存服务\nInventoryService" as IS
participant "支付模拟\nPaymentMock" as PAY
database "MySQL 8" as DB

== 阶段一：创建订单 ==

U -> FE : 选择商品、填写地址、提交订单
FE -> GW : POST /api/orders (Bearer Token + items)
activate GW
GW -> GW : 解析JWT，校验USER角色与登录态
GW -> OS : createOrder(dto)
activate OS
OS -> DB : 查询商品状态与实时价格
activate DB
DB --> OS : 商品信息(status=1, price)
deactivate DB
OS -> OS : 服务端重算金额，生成订单号
OS -> IS : lockStock(productId, qty)
activate IS
IS -> DB : 乐观锁扣减stock、增加locked_stock
activate DB
DB --> IS : 预占结果
deactivate DB
IS --> OS : 预占成功
deactivate IS
OS -> DB : 插入orders与order_item(status=0待支付)
activate DB
DB --> OS : 订单ID
deactivate DB
OS --> GW : 待支付订单(订单号/金额/支付超时时间)
deactivate OS
GW --> FE : Result(code=0, data=订单)
deactivate GW
FE --> U : 显示待支付订单与支付倒计时

== 阶段二：支付订单 ==

U -> FE : 点击支付，选择支付方式
FE -> GW : POST /api/orders/{id}/pay
activate GW
GW -> OS : pay(orderId, payMethod)
activate OS
OS -> DB : 校验订单状态(status=0)
DB --> OS : 状态合法
OS -> PAY : 发起模拟支付(amount)
activate PAY
PAY --> OS : 支付成功(tradeNo)
deactivate PAY
OS -> IS : confirmDeduction(orderId)
activate IS
IS -> DB : 扣减locked_stock，写inventory_log
DB --> IS : 完成
deactivate IS
OS -> DB : 插入payment_record，更新订单status 0→1
DB --> OS : 完成
OS --> GW : 支付结果
deactivate OS
GW --> FE : Result(code=0, data=支付记录)
deactivate GW
FE --> U : 显示待发货状态

note over OS, DB
  下单与库存预占在同一事务内完成
  乐观锁version防止超卖，库存不足返回10001
  状态非法流转返回10003
end note

@enduml
